<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
    <Import Project="../../Version.props" Label="版本号定义"/>

    <PropertyGroup>
        <Description>GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Match,GFX Online 对局能力包:权威对局 Actor/同步协议/重连/幂等结算/样例玩法与撮合成功通知推送(InMemory 默认存储,描述符服务面 Override 替换)+ admin handlers(end_abnormal_match). Match capability package for the GFX Online family: authoritative match actor, sync protocol, reconnect, idempotent settlement, the sample game and the match-made notification push with in-memory default stores and admin handlers. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com</Description>
        <PackageTags>GameFrameX,Capability,Online,Match,Authoritative,Settlement,Reconnect,GameServer</PackageTags>
